OL,3,GNEWSAHotel to be built on former
OL,4,Arailway station site
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork on a new city centre hotel at the
OL,7,Fsite of a former railway station will
OL,8,Fbegin in 2027, it has been confirmed.
OL,10,FThe hotel will be built on the site of
OL,11,Fthe former Wakefield Westgate station
OL,12,Fand when completed it would "meet
OL,13,Fgrowing demand" from visitors and
OL,14,Fbusiness travellers, according to
OL,15,FWakefield Council.
OL,17,FThe 110-room hotel was also expected to
OL,18,Fboost tourism and create new jobs, with
OL,19,Fdevelopers saying it was expected to
OL,20,Fopen its doors to customers by winter
OL,21,F2028.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
