OL,3,GNEWSAHotel to be built on former
OL,4,Arailway station site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council spokesperson said: "We want
OL,7,Fto give people the opportunity to stay
OL,8,Ffor longer and enjoy everything
OL,9,FWakefield has to offer - that's great
OL,10,Fnews for our businesses and the local
OL,11,Feconomy."
